cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ErosionBench, please cite it as below."
title: "ErosionBench: Measuring Alignment Decay in Multi-Agent LLM Systems"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark that measures alignment decay in multi-agent LLM systems: how attack
  success escalates from a single agent to a cooperating multi-agent mesh, and how
  much of that decay each defense layer recovers. 1,728 scenarios across 4 enterprise
  domains and 16 attack classes mapped to the OWASP LLM Top-10 (2025), with
  family-disjoint calibration/evaluation splits.
type: dataset
